abstract: >-
  Markerless 6D object pose tracking (RGB-D, CAD-model based) driving a reactive robot arm:
  closed-loop pick-and-place and cube stacking that adapts as a person moves objects.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - robot manipulation
  - 6D pose estimation
  - markerless tracking
  - RGB-D
  - human-robot interaction
  - visual servoing
  - sim-to-real
  - reinforcement learning
